            0.115,
            0.387,
            0.881,
            0.423
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q. In the other exercises that you did above, did you notice that subtracting a negative number was the same as adding the corresponding positive number?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.432,
            0.585,
            0.45
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans. Yes. The infinite lift reminds us of a number line."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.459,
            0.86,
            0.504
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q. If, from 5 you wish to go over to 9, how far must you travel along the number line?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Ans. 4 steps."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.513,
            0.881,
            0.559
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q. Now, from 9, if you wish to go to 3, how much must you travel along the number line?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Ans. One must travel 6 steps backward or move (-6) from 9 to go to 3."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.595,
            0.686,
            0.613
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q. Now, from 3, if you wish to go to – 2, how far must you travel?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.622,
            0.717,
            0.64
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans. One must travel 5 steps backward or move (-5) from 3 to go to -2."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
